"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Vegetarian","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Z4PF4EtM12L7nwOHZHFJNA","review_id":"9WyTyuRGWLhPyqSEENaAOw","date":"2016-01-22T19:44:18","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.944036602973938,"text_excerpt":"I had 2 friends visiting in town from back home. One of them is Vegan, so it was a must that we go here. It was actually so good that we went twice! They have a bright and cheerful location in the Lower Garden District. Both times we went were more of a late lunch, so it wasn't crowded. I like the ambiance there a lot and they play really good music. I highly recommend the Southern Fried Po Boy (fried tofu), the Eggplant Po Boy, the Eggplant Pomodoro, the Artichoke Cakes and the Nachos. They were all excellent. I recommend skipping the BBQ Seitan Sandwich and the Gumbo. The sandwich was not that great and it was a very small portion. The Gumbo was more tomato soupy. The servers were all v..."},{"business_id":"Z4PF4EtM12L7nwOHZHFJNA","review_id":"HlYgNTSNMXF1ySDQPK5dcQ","date":"2018-09-01T21:30:11","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9415026903152466,"text_excerpt":"Super excited to find a plant based restaurant. It's an Uber ride or a good walk from the tourist area but well worth it. Started off with the artichoke cakes and chili cheese (table next to us ordered them and just had to). Both were really good and didn't leave a bite. For entree we got the tofu poboy and bbq sandwich which were awesome. The bread was amazing on both ! We also opted for the Mac and cheese which was perfect with some hot sauce added. Very creamy but needed a little more to give it that little extra. For dessert we had the vegan beignets which they are known for. Was a great meal, pretty busy when we went, but quick service . Also next door to a nice coffee shop and small..."},{"business_id":"Z4PF4EtM12L7nwOHZHFJNA","review_id":"zuK2-it9tn0gz8K2f-a9Xg","date":"2020-02-14T22:25:49","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9412416219711304,"text_excerpt":"Seed is really good. I want to preface this by saying I love meat as much as the next but this place is really good regardless of your dietary preferences. I went there for lunch and we shared the tacos, carrot pasta, mushroom bagna cuada, eggplant shawarma, and finally the carrot cake. Everything on the menu is sharable which is a good thing because everything looked delicious. The tacos were probably my favorite followed by the shawarma. I really don't think you could go wrong if you blindly picked 3 or 4 dishes off the menu. Will definitely be back to try a few more. The service was great too. We were seated right away and had food on the table five minutes after ordering. Really aweso..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Z4PF4EtM12L7nwOHZHFJNA","photo_id":"ebcM3bqV2F1ENBPaDKSxQQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ebcM3bqV2F1ENBPaDKSxQQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.86341929435729